		(descr "DFN10, 2 x 3 mm; Gas gauge for the Li-ion battery (the A version, for 4.2 V cells), read by the MCU over I2C1. Marked O205, ST's code for the STC3115AIQT (8128 is likely a date or lot code). Its pinout matches every traced pin with pin 1 at the first corner outlined: ALM (1) to MCU PA10, SDA (2), SCL (3), GND (5) and RSTIO (7) through the ground pour, CG (6) on pack - to sense the current across X4, BATD/CD (8) through R12, VCC (9) on battery +, VIN (10) on battery + through the R13/C6 filter; NC (4) unconnected")
		(property "Reference" "PWR2"
