		(descr "4 pads, ~1.2 mm square; Small square part with a pad at each corner, between C9 and C8/C10. Pads named by corner in the front photo. Likely roles from its nets: TL input from the supply on the left button (pad 19), TR output to VDDUSB (the MCU's USB supply, pin 40, with C9-C12), BL enable from MCU PB3 (through R16) and the charger input (through R29), BR GND, which also goes to C10's ground pad and carries the dot seen on the part; not confirmed")
