		(descr "SOT-23, 2.9 x 1.3 mm; 16 V Zener diode (Philips/NXP PMBZ52xx series datasheet: 8W is the PMBZ5246B's marking code, the leading p means made in Hong Kong; pin 1 anode, 2 not connected, 3 cathode). Pads named by position in the front photo (which is mirrored): with the marking upright, pin 3 (cathode) is R, pin 1 (anode) BL and pin 2 (not connected) TL. The anode is on the charger's input supply and the cathode on the supply that feeds the OLED boost converter; TL, though unconnected inside, sits on battery +")
