		(at 18.309523 19.470238)
		(descr "3 terminals, SOT-23 style, ~1.5 x 1.2 mm body; Black 3-terminal part across from X9, with two small pads on one side and a large one on the other. Pads named by position in the front photo. Its nets match a P-MOSFET switch between USB power and the charger: TL on VBUS (source), R on the charger input (drain), BL on the gate, which R10 holds at VBUS (off) and the STUSB4500L pulls low through R4 (VBUS_EN_SNK) once USB power is negotiated. Marking not read; not confirmed")
