		(layer "B.Cu")
		(uuid "7cbf8fe3-0baf-5dac-92e2-a25f7b714d61")
		(at 54.10119 19.089285)
		(descr "16-pin board-to-board receptacle, 0.4 mm pitch, 2 rows; Connector to the display/button board. Pads measured in the bare back photo; numbering assumed odd pins on the left column and even on the right, from the top in the back photo, not checked against the datasheet. MP1-4 are the hold-down pads, all grounded. Pins 2 and 7 are GND; 13-16 are not connected. With the display's SSD1312 controller, the rest read as: 1 MOSI, 3 and 11 +3.3V (VDD), 4 CLK, 5 D/C#, 6 RES#, 8 CS#, 9 VCOMH (capacitor only), 10 IREF (resistor to ground), 12 VCC panel supply from the X10 boost converter (TLV61046A)")
